WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:04,880
you are back

2
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:06,550
what is this reaction

3
00:00:07,550 --> 00:00:10,310
Are you curious if I found any good treasures when I went out this time?

4
00:00:10,590 --> 00:00:14,640
I'm not Liu Qingsi

5
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:17,540
If you are not Liu Qingsi, who else can you be?

6
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:19,500
Are you talking nonsense with me here, fighting for your eyes?

7
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:21,620
I'm afraid you are lying. Please tell me first.

8
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:23,380
What is your relationship with Liu Qingsi?

9
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:24,460
I'm her boss

10
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:27,260
She is also the boss who pays her salary.

11
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:29,580
She was teasing me on purpose just now

12
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:32,420
Why don't you pretend to be stupid with me?

13
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:34,370
It’s really not Liu Qingsi

14
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:37,620
You teased me on purpose last time in Wucheng Insect Pond

15
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:39,500
This time I pretended not to recognize it again

16
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:41,820
This girl has quite a few tricks up her sleeve.
